1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,673
I never believed in vampires.

2
00:00:02,723 --> 00:00:04,538
But my grandmother did.

3
00:00:04,769 --> 00:00:07,009
She slept with a sickle across her throat.

4
00:00:07,059 --> 00:00:08,312
Every night.

5
00:00:08,382 --> 00:00:09,822
And a little iron padlock,

6
00:00:09,872 --> 00:00:11,863
locked round her big toe.

7
00:00:12,013 --> 00:00:13,138
When I asked why,

8
00:00:13,188 --> 00:00:13,828
she said,

9
00:00:13,878 --> 00:00:15,688
so I stay where I'm put.

10
00:00:16,159 --> 00:00:17,369
She made me promise.

11
00:00:17,419 --> 00:00:18,489
When she died,

12
00:00:18,539 --> 00:00:20,713
both would go in the coffin with her.

13
00:00:21,102 --> 00:00:22,232
I'm thirty now.

14
00:00:22,282 --> 00:00:24,028
We buried her last week.

15
00:00:24,099 --> 00:00:25,774
The undertaker wouldn't do it.

16
00:00:25,824 --> 00:00:27,479
And vampires aren't real.

17
00:00:27,529 --> 00:00:29,021
So I didn't push.

18
00:00:29,091 --> 00:00:30,941
They're in my kitchen drawer.

19
00:00:31,251 --> 00:00:31,921
Last night,

20
00:00:31,971 --> 00:00:33,422
the drawer was open.

21
00:00:33,472 --> 00:00:35,237
The padlock was gone.

22
00:00:35,707 --> 00:00:37,102
There was soil on the floor.

23
00:00:37,152 --> 00:00:37,777
Wet.

24
00:00:37,827 --> 00:00:39,201
Bare footprints.

25
00:00:39,271 --> 00:00:40,783
They went up the stairs.

26
00:00:40,833 --> 00:00:42,078
To my room.

27
00:00:42,548 --> 00:00:45,928
That sickle was never keeping anything away from her.

28
00:00:45,978 --> 00:00:48,063
It was keeping her in the ground.

29
00:00:48,693 --> 00:00:51,867
Then something cold closed round my big toe.

30
00:00:52,017 --> 00:00:54,070
So you stay where you're put.
